      {
        "h_title": "Transport and terminal transfers",
        "main_title": "Phuket Airport (HKT)",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Looking for the best ways to get to and from Phuket Airport? There are plenty of ground transportation options available.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Airport parking",
        "main_title": "Phuket Airport (HKT)",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Phuket Airport offers two car parks, one opposite the international terminal building and another opposite the domestic terminal building. Both car parks have fixed hourly rates, and the first 15 minutes is free.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Limousine",
        "main_title": "Phuket Airport (HKT)",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Feeling a little bit fancy? Luxurious airport limousine transfers are available at Phuket Airport, near the Arrival Halls.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Taxis",
        "main_title": "Phuket Airport (HKT)",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "A range of different taxi service providers, including Grab and CABB, are available to make your journey to or from Phuket Airport a seamless one.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Car rental",
        "main_title": "Phuket Airport (HKT)",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Car rental companies, including AVIS, Budget, Europcar and Hertz, are available at Phuket Airport. Talk to your Travel Expert about organising car hire for your trip or book it yourself online before you leave.",
            "url": "http://www.flightcentre.com.au/stores",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "http://www.flightcentre.com.au/stores",
                "anchor_text": "Talk to your Travel Expert"
              },
              {
                "url": "https://cars.flightcentre.com.au/",
                "anchor_text": "book it yourself online"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Public transport",
        "main_title": "Phuket Airport (HKT)",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "One of the most affordable and convenient ways to travel between Phuket Airport and Phuket Town is by public transport. The 8411 Airport Bus is an official government bus, providing air-conditioned transportation from Terminal 2 (the Domestic Terminal) to Phuket Town. Look out for the orange buses! Visit the Phuket Mahanakorn website for up-to-date information on timetables and fares.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Terminal transfers",
        "main_title": "Phuket Airport (HKT)",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "The terminals at Phuket Airport are connected by a walkway. For assistance transferring between the terminals, talk to the ground staff.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Lounges",
        "main_title": "Phuket Airport (HKT)",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Bangkok Airways Blue Ribbon Lounge Terminal 2, Domestic Open from 7:30am to 7:30pm daily",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "The Coral Executive Lounge Terminal 1, International Open 24 hours daily",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Thai Airways Royal Orchid Lounge Terminal 2, Domestic Open from 8am to 9pm daily",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Which airlines fly into and out of Phuket Airport?",
        "main_title": "Phuket Airport (HKT)",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "A number of domestic and international airlines fly into and out of Phuket Airport. Major airlines servicing the airport include AirAsia, Bangkok Airways, Cathay Pacific, Emirates, Etihad Airways, Hong Kong Airlines, Jetstar, Malaysia Airlines, Qatar Airways, Singapore Airlines and more.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "How early should I arrive for international and domestic flights at Phuket Airport?",
        "main_title": "Phuket Airport (HKT)",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "As a general rule, you should aim to arrive at Phuket Airport two hours before your scheduled departure time for domestic flights and at least three hours before international flights. This should give you plenty of time to complete check-in, drop your bags and pass through any necessary security screenings before your boarding time. Keep in mind that you may experience longer lines and delays during busy travel periods, so check with the airport, airline or your Travel Expert directly for more information on recommended arrival times.",
            "url": "https://www.flightcentre.com.au/stores",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.flightcentre.com.au/stores",
                "anchor_text": "or your Travel Expert"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "What are the transport options from Phuket Airport to the city centre?",
        "main_title": "Phuket Airport (HKT)",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "There are plenty of transport options available from Phuket Airport to Phuket Town, including public transport, limousine transfers, taxis and car rentals.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Are there airport lounges at Phuket Airport and how can I access them?",
        "main_title": "Phuket Airport (HKT)",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Yes, there are several airport lounges at Phuket Airport, including the Bangkok Airways Blue Ribbon Lounge and Thai Airways Royal Orchid Lounge. Access to airport lounges may be possible depending on your ticket class, frequent flyer membership, credit card benefits or by purchasing a day pass. Check with the airline directly or talk to your Travel Expert for more information on how to access the airport lounges at Phuket Airport.",
            "url": "https://www.flightcentre.com.au/stores",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.flightcentre.com.au/stores",
                "anchor_text": "talk to your Travel Expert"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Can I sleep at Phuket Airport and are there quiet zones, hotels or showers?",
        "main_title": "Phuket Airport (HKT)",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "While there are no showers or hotels within the airport itself, there are plenty of great places to stay while exploring Phuket. If you’re looking for a quiet space to relax while you wait for your flight, check the opening times and whether you’re able to access any of the airline lounges at Phuket Airport.",
            "url": "https://www.flightcentre.com.au/stays/th-phu-phuket",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.flightcentre.com.au/stays/th-phu-phuket",
                "anchor_text": "great places to stay while exploring Phuket"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Can I earn loyalty points or travel perks when booking flights to or from Phuket Airport?",
        "main_title": "Phuket Airport (HKT)",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "You may be able to earn loyalty points or rewards on eligible flights to or from Phuket booked with us. When booking online, you’ll see a place to add your loyalty program or frequent flyer membership details if this is available, or you can ask your Travel Expert for help when booking in-store. If the booking meets your program’s requirements, you’ll earn points! For more information, check with your specific loyalty program and see our Booking Terms and Conditions.",
            "url": "https://www.flightcentre.com.au/stores",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.flightcentre.com.au/stores",
                "anchor_text": "ask your Travel Expert"
              },
              {
                "url": "https://help.flightcentre.com.au/s/article/booking-terms-conditions-au",
                "anchor_text": "Booking Terms and Conditions"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Keen for even more travel perks? Subscribe to our email list for birthday surprises, competition entries, exclusive deals and VIP pre-sale access to the hottest holiday savings around.",
            "url": "https://www.flightcentre.com.au/p/subscribe",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.flightcentre.com.au/p/subscribe",
                "anchor_text": "Subscribe"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "What are check-in times and baggage rules at Phuket Airport?",
        "main_title": "Phuket Airport (HKT)",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Check-in times and baggage rules for flights departing from Phuket Airport will vary depending on your ticket, so make sure you confirm with your airline in advance. Remember, it’s often possible to check in online or via your airline’s app, which can help save time at the airport. For more information or help finding your check-in times and baggage limits, talk to your Travel Expert.",
            "url": "https://www.flightcentre.com.au/stores",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.flightcentre.com.au/stores",
                "anchor_text": "talk to your Travel Expert"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Which terminal should I use at Phuket Airport?",
        "main_title": "Phuket Airport (HKT)",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Phuket Airport has three different terminals, with Terminal 1 being used for international flights, Terminal 2 for domestic and Terminal X typically reserved for charter flights and to handle overflow.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Is there short-term and long-term parking at Phuket Airport and what are the rates?",
        "main_title": "Phuket Airport (HKT)",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Yes, short-term and long-term parking is available at Phuket Airport. There are two car parks, one opposite the international terminal building and another opposite the domestic terminal building. Check with the airport directly for more information on booking airport parking and the current rates.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "What family facilities are available at Phuket Airport?",
        "main_title": "Phuket Airport (HKT)",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Travelling with the little ones? Phuket Airport offers baby care rooms, family bathrooms and a dedicated Kid Zone in the International Departure area so that kids can play and burn off some energy before boarding their flight.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "What shopping and duty-free options are available at Phuket Airport?",
        "main_title": "Phuket Airport (HKT)",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Keen to do a little retail therapy at Phuket Airport? You’re in luck! There are plenty of stores available for you to browse before your flight, as well as duty-free shops and dining options. Check Phuket Airport’s terminal map or website for an up-to-date list of stores and their opening information.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "When is the cheapest time to book flights to Phuket Airport?",
        "main_title": "Phuket Airport (HKT)",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "While last-minute sale fares to and from Phuket Airport may become available, you’ll generally find it pays to plan ahead, especially if you're booking international flights. As a rough guide, we recommend booking domestic flights three to six months in advance and international flights six to nine months before you plan to fly. When it comes to balancing flexible travel dates with the biggest savings, this should give you the best of both worlds!",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Ready to book your flight?",
        "main_title": "Phuket Airport (HKT)",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Book online, in-store, over the phone, or via the app. Booking with Flight Centre means access to airports worldwide and expert advice on the best routes for your journey.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      }
